<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Agent Details - Sova</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand" href="index.html">VALORANT PROTOCOL</a>
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse">
                <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="index.html">Home</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" href="details.html">Details</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="about.html">About</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="new-character-form.html">Add a Character</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container my-5">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-md-6 text-center">
                <img src="images/sova.png" class="img-fluid rounded shadow border border-secondary" alt="Sova">
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold" style="color: #ff4655;">SOVA</h1>
                <span class="badge badge-initiator fs-6 mb-3">Initiator</span>
                
                <ul class="list-unstyled mt-3 text-light">
                    <li><strong>Real Name:</strong> Alexander (Sasha) Novikov</li>
                    <li><strong>Origin:</strong> Russia</li>
                    <li><strong>First Appearance:</strong> Valorant Beta (2020)</li>
                    <li><strong>Signature Ability:</strong> Recon Bolt</li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="mt-4 border-bottom pb-2 text-white">Abilities</h3>
                <ul class="text-light">
                    <li><strong>Owl Drone (C):</strong> Deploy a drone to mark enemy locations with darts.</li>
                    <li><strong>Shock Bolt (Q):</strong> Fire an explosive bolt that damages nearby players.</li>
                    <li><strong>Recon Bolt (E):</strong> Fire a sonar bolt that reveals position of nearby enemies.</li>
                    <li><strong>Hunter's Fury (X):</strong> Fire up to three energy blasts across the whole map.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="mt-4 border-bottom pb-2 text-white">Backstory</h3>
                <p class="text-light">Born from the eternal winter of Russia's tundra, Sova tracks, finds, and eliminates enemies with ruthless efficiency and precision archery.</p>

                <a href="index.html" class="btn btn-outline-light mt-3">Back to Gallery</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>